        "text": "0\nSkip to Content\nOpen Menu Close Menu\nOpen Menu Close Menu\n### WIN WITH VIN!\n# Join Vin in Transforming Pleasanton\nVin is an entrepreneur, husband, father, philanthropist, and longtime Pleasanton resident. With more than two decades of business leadership experience, he has founded and built successful companies, created jobs, managed large organizations and budgets, and worked alongside small businesses, nonprofits, and community leaders throughout the Tri-Valley.\nVin is running for City Council to bring his business experience and problem-solving approach to Pleasanton. His priorities are strengthening the city's finances, supporting local businesses and economic growth, keeping our neighborhoods safe, investing in aging infrastructure and safe water, and protecting the exceptional quality of life that makes Pleasanton such a special place to call home.\nMeet Vin Kruttiventi\n## VIN'S PRIORITIES\n### Restore Fiscal Responsibility\n### Keep Pleasanton Safe\n### Support Local Businesses & Strengthen Our Economy\n### Revitalize Stoneridge & Key Commercial Areas\n### Fix Roads & Invest in Infrastructure\n### Protect Our Water, Parks & Quality of Life\n### SIGN UP TO JOIN THE TEAM\n### AND WIN WITH VIN!",
